# Forensic evidence: the R3 readiness record exactly as the team filed it.
gate R3 author:amara reviewers-needed:2
require failover_matrix_all_pass
require threat_model_updated
require gameday_plan_reviewed
require bench_safety_checklist safety
evidence failover_matrix_all_pass pass file:logs/m6_failover.log
evidence gameday_plan_reviewed pass file:docs/gameday.md
evidence bench_safety_checklist missing file:-
test failover_follower_crash pass
